/P 70 0 R
/E (Short-term forecasting of household appliance energy demand is directly relevant to smart-home energy management and demand-response scheduling. This report forecasts appliance energy consumption 24 hours ahead using the UCI Appliances Energy Prediction dataset, which combines appliance energy use with indoor sensor and outdoor weather readings recorded at 10-minute intervals over roughly four and a half months.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
